WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:03.410
His name is Robert Lloyd Schellenberg.

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:08.590
A Canadian national in Chinese custody since
20-14.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:13.230
Originally he had been sentenced to 15 years
in prison for masterminding a drug smuggling

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:17.349
plot, a charge he continues to deny.

00:00:17.349 --> 00:00:22.220
But in a surprise move, an appeals court allowed
Chinese prosecutors to retry him.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.220
The result...

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:30.529
The defendant is guilty of smuggling drugs
and is sentenced to death.

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:37.050
All of his personal assets will be confiscated.

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:43.329
Canada's embassy has urged its citizens to
be cautious when traveling to China.

00:00:43.329 --> 00:00:45.859
And the Prime Minister has also expressed
his misgivings.

00:00:45.859 --> 00:00:52.630
But I will say it is of extreme concern to
us as a government as it should be to all

00:00:52.630 --> 00:00:59.510
our international friends and allies that
China has chosen to begin to arbitrarily apply

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:06.060
death penalty in cases facing - as in this
case - facing a Canadian.

00:01:06.060 --> 00:01:12.119
The verdict represents a new escalation in
a diplomatic spat between Beijing and Ottawa.

00:01:12.119 --> 00:01:16.159
Observers have linked Schellenberg's fresh
conviction to Canada's arrest of this women

00:01:16.159 --> 00:01:18.390
- Meng Wanzhou.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:24.600
She's a senior executive at telecommunications
giant Huawei and the daughter of its founder.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:29.200
She's accused of helping the company bypass
US sanctions and American authorites are seeking

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:30.649
her extradition.

00:01:30.649 --> 00:01:37.760
Schellenberg's retrail was boxed through just
weeks afer Wanzhou was taken into custody.

00:01:37.760 --> 00:01:42.501
And it now seems her fate, as well as that
of Schellenberg and two other Canadians in

00:01:42.501 --> 00:01:48.049
Chinese custody might not be decided in a
court of law but rather on the international

00:01:48.049 --> 00:03:20.650
stage.

